PTX MP+fence-restrict-cta+not-transitive
"P0 writes global d, then shared s, then uses the restricted release fence. s is ordered; d is not, although d precedes s in program order: the restricted edges are not closed transitively (D19). Expected: allowed."
{
s=0 @cta 0;
d=0;
f=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                         | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0 ;
 st.weak.global d, 1                              | ld.relaxed.cluster r0, f ;
 st.weak.shared::cta s, 1                         | fence.acq_rel.cluster    ;
 fence.release.sync_restrict::shared::cta.cluster | ld.weak.global r1, d     ;
 st.relaxed.cluster f, 1                          |                          ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
